{"kind":"Article","sha256":"d1f25bc175b23f25b4bc27e95c54e81bb63b65511b34a164fd7b7db02a9d4aac","slug":"defense","location":"/combat/defense.md","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Defense","github":"https://github.com/SkillWeaverNexus/skillweavernexus.github.io","keywords":[],"exports":[{"format":"md","filename":"defense.md","url":"/build/defense-3dba9fb277433d784055614dbaf2378a.md"}]},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"When an enemy of some kind chooses to attack you, you have multiple options for how to defend yourself. When the attack is declared, but before you know whether it hits and for how much damage, you must decide to do one of three forms of defense:","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"hjQE943rJW"}],"key":"iYmqQdoGbf"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Take it: absorb the damage. [0 stamina]","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"Hkope78Nkl"}],"key":"zfs5M3LhSQ"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parry it: deflect half of the damage [1 stamina]","position":{"start":{"line":6,"column":1},"end":{"line":6,"column":1}},"key":"uXcoTPUr7y"}],"key":"u5aXy8Ciog"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":9,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dodge it: evade the damage entirely [2 stamina]","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"P2VZ8UDVdX"}],"key":"wuTwjq329v"}],"key":"vnoam9vME7"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The active forms of damage avoidance in SWN require some stamina to use, making it worthwhile to not use all 6 during your attack action. As we will discuss in equipment below, armor can modulate the stamina costs of parrying and dodging, the tradeoff being damage negation when taking blows.","position":{"start":{"line":10,"column":1},"end":{"line":10,"column":1}},"key":"WzeyHrMAft"}],"key":"gPFqoez7yZ"},{"type":"admonition","kind":"note","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Note","key":"e8PT9Hylo2"}],"key":"EDUqDQGOdv"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"The rules for defense apply to psychic/mental or internal/magic attacks as well as physical ones. A psychic lance can be parried or dodged by virtue of a steeling of emptying of the mind. Psychic attacks do bypass most armor, though some equipment exists to shield against such attacks.","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"key":"Pc20IFhCHB"}],"key":"SCXNF5qdrj"}],"key":"IB2K6RsfVe"}],"key":"fZvT4D3mmr"}],"key":"PwBY7odt1J"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}},"footer":{"navigation":{"prev":{"title":"Attacks","url":"/attacks","group":"Reasoning Origins"},"next":{"title":"Reactions","url":"/reactions","group":"Reasoning Origins"}}},"domain":"http://localhost:3000"}